2026-07-23 cont575: *** P1 ARCHITECTURAL ROOT of the final blocker *** convertVectorToMMAOps needs MEMREFS: transferReadSupportsMMAMatrixType -> getStaticallyKnownRowStride -> dyn_cast<MemRefType>(type). The attention DECOMP coop path runs at TENSOR level (pre-bufferize), so the transfer_reads are on tensors -> dyn_cast<MemRefType> null -> read unsupported -> 0 mma ops -> graceful-fallback unrolls to scalar (the 8192 vector<1x1>). The FFN coop pipeline runs coop/MMA POST-bufferize (memrefs); attention is PRE-bufferize. NOT the transpose per se (getStaticallyKnownRowStride handles transposed maps IF given a memref). ROOT = tensor-vs-memref STAGE MISMATCH; matches the code's own comment "shared-memory-staged flash needs a proper pipeline RESTRUCTURE to bufferize the scores... grafting promote into pre-bufferize path SEGFAULTS". So P1's final step = restructure the attention pipeline to BUFFERIZE before the coop/MMA passes (the documented-hard step). My 5 committed fixes (specialize/GV-wiring/MMA-wiring/config-trim/scale-hoist) advanced IR to coop-ready TENSOR contracts; the memref-stage wall is the core structural work. Metric still 0 — blocked on bufferization stage, not a small rewrite.
